  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "* In 3d series Vanadium has highest enthalpy of atomization and colour of $\\mathrm{V}^{+3}$ is green.<br />* Oxide form by $\\mathrm{V}^{+3}$ is $\\mathrm{V}_2 \\mathrm{O}_3$ (Basic oxide)",
    "image": null
  },
